    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While traveling through hyperspace, your ship's drive field suddenly fails. Moments later, a relentless alien force attacks, determined to ensure your journey ends here. Now, <strong>Stranded In Starlight</strong>, survival is your only option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast gameplay sessions (under 30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different weapons and utilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive hordes of enemies that grow larger and stronger as time passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and upgrade your ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs you can permanently upgrade your ship and unlock new abilities</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While traveling through hyperspace, your ship's drive field suddenly fails. Moments later, a relentless alien force attacks, determined to ensure your journey ends here. Now, <strong>Stranded In Starlight</strong>, survival is your only option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast gameplay sessions (under 30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different weapons and utilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive hordes of enemies that grow larger and stronger as time passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and upgrade your ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs you can permanently upgrade your ship and unlock new abilities</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Stranded in Starlight is a top-down roguelite where you pilot a spaceship armed with a variety of unique weapons and utilities. Battle relentless enemy hordes and powerful bosses as you upgrade your ship, adapting to each challenge in an ever-changing fight for survival.",
